      "writtenOn": "2019-06-20T00:39:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For what it\u0027s worth, after enabling wake on EC_HOST_EVENT_PD_MCU on my dark-resume enabled nocturne w/ Ravi\u0027s patches, the system does a dark resume for charger removal/insertion and then falls back asleep. It might not be obvious on a fanless unit without a power LED like nocturne.",
      "parentUuid": "a5607abd_41395529",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 600,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 600,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "c249cf48cad12b39f4a2ab004d32ec7caab3f982",
