        "id": 1003000
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-06-20T00:53:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But does it behave differently if the EC_HOST_EVENT_PD_MCU triggers wake on DP Alt mode change? Probably not? I think you see the device falling back to sleep because powerd does not see PD as wake-capable device. Ravi can correct me if this is not true.",
      "parentUuid": "d121c60b_c74f20c3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 600,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 600,
        "endChar": 21
      },
